ferrisfetch (0.8.0-1~ppa1~noble) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release version 0.8.0: Filesystem types, ZRAM compression detection, and redesigned ASCII logos.
  * Add filesystem type discovery on Disks (ext4, btrfs, ntfs, 9p, vfat, zfs).
  * Add active ZRAM compression algorithm discovery on Swap (LZ4, ZSTD, LZO).
  * Redesign high-fidelity ASCII art logos across all Linux distributions and Windows.

